1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
We're team ReTardis.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Astronaut health monitoring,
because Earth is far away.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,500
Meet HeMoSo: twelve daily readings,

4
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:10,000
each checked against
your own usual range.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,500
She logs a fever of 38.5 °C
and a fast pulse.

6
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:15,000
HeMoSo compares them
with her usual range,

7
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,000
scores the evidence,

8
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:20,000
and says: tell the CMO.
Built from NASA's open data.

9
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:23,000
From lunar missions to Mars:
the same daily check,

10
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:26,000
with every limit
and its source on screen.

11
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Because exploring further means
taking better care of those who explore.
